1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,838
Anything you do to water lowers its free energy: dissolve something in it, or let it cling to a surface.

2
00:00:07,838 --> 00:00:13,268
So every solution, and every cell, has a negative water potential.

3
00:00:13,268 --> 00:00:19,179
And water always moves from higher to lower: from less negative to more negative.

